{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a fast-paced micro dungeon crawler, set in a colorful tabletop world of adventuring animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test012345.gif?t=1743350400\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A card-combining battle system inspired by the old-school ATB (Active Time Battle) JRPG combat and physical card games such as Star Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three varied regions to master, each with their own enemies, cards and trinkets to find!<br><br>Beautiful card artwork filled with colorful animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket-sized adventure with a playtime of around 2 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/test0123457.gif?t=1743350400\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968070?t=1743350400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743350400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743350400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743350400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a fast-paced micro dungeon crawler, set in a colorful tabletop world of adventuring animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app